            <a href="/Pictorialist-Photography" style="color:#8b5a2b; font-weight:600; text-decoration:underline;">Pictorialist Photography</a> - Historical roots and modern pictorialism
          </li>
          <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;">
            <a href="/Western-Fine-Art-Photography" style="color:#8b5a2b; font-weight:600; text-decoration:underline;">Western Fine Art Photography</a> — The broader Western context
